Title: Ancient Peruvian city more than 3,000 years old unveiled
URL: https://edition.cnn.com/2025/07/08/science/penico-ancient-city-peru-scli-intl
Content: # Ancient Peruvian city more than 3,000 years old unveiled

—

An ancient Peruvian city that was a thriving hub of trade more than 3,000 years ago has been unveiled by archaeologists.

