**********Extracted claims**********

"Fibermaxxing" is the practice of consuming meals that help individuals meet or exceed daily fiber intake recommendations.
Fibermaxxing aims to improve gut health.
Fibermaxxing aims to support weight loss.
Videos with the "#fibermaxxing" tag have garnered tens of millions of views and likes.
Fibermaxxing videos typically feature people making and eating fiber-rich meals.
