The administrative leave followed concerns related to classroom management, professional judgment, and student favoritism.
The Lewisville Independent School District stated this information in a statement to CNN.
An internal investigation by the Lewisville Independent School District found no evidence of inappropriate behavior by Andrew McGann with students.
Andrew McGann resigned from the Lewisville Independent School District in May 2023.
Andrew McGann worked at Plano Independent School District for four days in August 2024.
Andrew McGann resigned from the Plano Independent School District before the first day of school.
The Plano Independent School District informed CNN of Andrew McGann's resignation.
The Plano Independent School District stated that all district employees must undergo strict hiring processes and procedures as prescribed by law.
These procedures include background checks and fingerprinting, with no adverse findings at the time of Andrew McGann's hire.
