The lead prosecutor intends to pursue the death penalty if Andrew McGann is convicted.
Washington County Prosecuting Attorney Brandon Carter stated that the case contains aggravators that warrant a jury deciding Andrew McGann's punishment.
Washington County Prosecuting Attorney Brandon Carter intends to present the case to a jury to decide the punishment.
The state will not waive the death penalty in this case.
